#
# File: 403-AlexaEchoService4-udp-sport49317-in-reply-accept.rule
# Policy: Allow remote Alexa Echo service4 server reply to local Alexa Echo servicer3 client
#
# Amazon documentation identifies several ports associated with Alexa services:
# Port	Protocol	Associated function
# 123	UDP	NTP/time synchronization
# 443	TCP	HTTPS
# 3478	TCP/UDP	STUN/TURN connectivity
# 4070	TCP/UDP	Alexa-associated service requirements
# 5353	UDP	mDNS
# 1900	UDP	SSDP discovery
# 33434	TCP/UDP	Alexa service connectivity
# 40317	TCP/UDP	Alexa service connectivity
# 49317	TCP/UDP	Alexa service connectivity
# Called by: zones/red/ip-filter-input-red-udp.chain

udp sport 49317 counter accept comment "remote-to-local AlexaEchoService4/UDP/49317 reply"
